NOTE ON DATA LICENSE:

This software retrieves data from OpenStreetMap through the Overpass API.
OpenStreetMap data is © OpenStreetMap contributors and is available under the
Open Database License (ODbL): https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/

When using, displaying, or building products with data returned by this software,
you must comply with the ODbL terms, which include providing attribution to
OpenStreetMap contributors. The required attribution is built into the footer
of this application by default.
